    "assessment": "Five distinct nodes pass both a full 50 GiB physical-space allowance above the 25% floor and 100% scheduling allowance after reservation. One-node loss leaves four candidates for three copies. New volumes are thin provisioned; snapshots, other growth and rebuild concurrency still need refreshed pre-merge checks. This verifies feasibility, not actual new replicas.",
    "retention": "Namespace, PVC, Secret and StorageClass are Flux prune protected. Flux Kustomization deletionPolicy Orphan preserves inventory on owner deletion. Retain prevents automatic PV/backend deletion if the PVC is deleted; it does not automatically recreate/rebind a deleted claim or roll back the database.",
    "backup": "Existing weekly Longhorn system backup requests volume-backup-policy=always and the new class uses backupTargetName=default. No completed backup or application-consistent restore of the new database exists yet. No additional backup Jobs or software introduced.",
